Pulse: Performance Engineering Runtime
    
Usage: pulse [options] [command]

Pulse: Modular Load Testing Framework powered by K6

Options:
  -V, --version                   output the version number
  -h, --help                      display help for command

Commands:
  run [options] [scenario] [env]  Execute a load test scenario using K6
  mock                            Start the integrated mock server
  init                            Initialize the framework workspace directories
                                  and template files
  gen <name>                      Generate a new load test scenario boilerplate
  add-env <key> <value>           Add a key-value environment variable to .env
  gui                             Launch the Pulse Cockpit Dashboard
  open <component>                Open framework components (e.g. 'gui')
  help [command]                  display help for command
